config MI_BINDER_PRIO
	tristate "Binder priority boost for Xiaomi UI paths"
	depends on ANDROID_BINDER_IPC
	default n
	help
	  Boosts scheduling priority (SCHED_FIFO) for critical Android
	  binder transactions involving SurfaceFlinger, SystemUI,
	  MIUI Home, and CameraServer.  Improves UI responsiveness
	  on Xiaomi devices.

